.el .ds Aq '
.TH octosnap-text 1  OctoSnap 
.SH NAME
octosnap\-text \- Recognise the text in an image and copy it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBoctosnap text\fR [\fB\-\-linebreaks\fR] [\fB\-\-single\-line\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Recognise the text in an image and copy it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-linebreaks\fR
Keep the line breaks the page had, overriding the setting
.TP
\fB\-\-single\-line\fR
Join each paragraph into one line, overriding the setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR]
The image file. Without one, select an area on screen and read that
